WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.703
Open the inbound agent (Support line)

00:00:02.703 --> 00:00:05.151
Expand Attach Number in the sidebar

00:00:05.151 --> 00:00:11.141
Filter by telephony: your provider's numbers

00:00:11.141 --> 00:00:14.531
Or Ringg's own numbers

00:00:14.531 --> 00:00:19.329
Pick the number under Inbound Number

00:00:19.329 --> 00:00:22.478
The number is attached; no separate save

00:00:22.478 --> 00:00:31.089
Outbound: pick the caller ID when you call

00:00:31.089 --> 00:00:34.095
Test numbers, your numbers; in-use ones are disabled
